   which is the one thing the old panel, where each control began where its label ended, did
   not do. The suffix shares the right half with its control. */
.srow {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; align-items: center;
  gap: .3rem .6rem; padding: .5rem 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line);

